 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He knows how we are formed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He remembers that we are dust",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Our days are like grass",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Blooming like a flower",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The wind passes over it",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And it is gone",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Its place knows it no more",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the steadfast love of the LORD",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rests from everlasting to everlasting",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On those who fear him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his righteousness too",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "On their children's children",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To those who keep his covenant",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And remember to obey his precepts",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
